NES for iDrive 7 - licences

This app is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later (LICENSE in this
folder), because it contains nes.wasm: the NES emulator FCEUmm in its libretro form
(https://github.com/libretro/libretro-fceumm, GPL-2.0-or-later, commit e0f3086; FCE Ultra by
Xodnizel and the FCEU / FCEUmm authors, see its Authors file) compiled to WebAssembly together with
a small frontend, mgu_libretro.c.

The complete source of nes.wasm is in https://github.com/clucraft/nes-idrive: the core, unchanged,
as the submodule vendor/libretro-fceumm; the frontend and the script that builds it in core/.

The app runs on the idrive7-apps kit (https://github.com/cauliflowermossgrape/idrive7-apps, MIT),
whose runtime is packed with it.

No games are included. The app runs .nes files its user supplies.

